{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Olga is an episodic first-person narrative walking simulator game with a simple story and stylized visuals.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/2b2743d8c1a54a5250e4fd6f5bae0fb1.poster.avif?t=1764516462\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/2b2743d8c1a54a5250e4fd6f5bae0fb1.webm?t=1764516462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/2b2743d8c1a54a5250e4fd6f5bae0fb1.mp4?t=1764516462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After coming across what\u2019s seemingly the biggest career opportunity of their lives, Olga\u2019s parents leave the country for a few months, leaving her at her grandparents\u2019 home in Belovodica, a hidden, isolated village deep within the mountains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/8c08eadcc85ca97616cd67018538ff3e.poster.avif?t=1764516462\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/8c08eadcc85ca97616cd67018538ff3e.webm?t=1764516462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/8c08eadcc85ca97616cd67018538ff3e.mp4?t=1764516462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds at a time when communication devices, such as cell phones, were not available to those living in such areas.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/0637167d06c0460d972310a0b02e96ec.poster.avif?t=1764516462\" width=600 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/0637167d06c0460d972310a0b02e96ec.webm?t=1764516462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/0637167d06c0460d972310a0b02e96ec.mp4?t=1764516462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Belovodica has to offer Olga is an isolated, peaceful, and quiet life with her old grandparents, or at least that\u2019s what she wanted to believe\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/9f6aea5cc7d631aee76708fa5ed12cbe.poster.avif?t=1764516462\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/9f6aea5cc7d631aee76708fa5ed12cbe.webm?t=1764516462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/9f6aea5cc7d631aee76708fa5ed12cbe.mp4?t=1764516462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-paced, there\u2019s no need to rush </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Combat Systems </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy and Short </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Slavic Tradition and Architecture </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant and easy-going, Not Demanding</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836740?t=1764516462","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764516462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764516462","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764516462","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3964590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1764516462\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1764516462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Take a moment to add Olga - Episode 1 to your Steam Wishlist! You can also Follow to receive updates about development and release dates, and it will help us reach more players.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Olga is an episodic first-person narrative walking simulator game with a simple story and stylized visuals.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/2b2743d8c1a54a5250e4fd6f5bae0fb1.poster.avif?t=1764516462\" width=600 height=172 ><so